libkirk - KIRK (PSP crypto engine) algorithms and keys
=======================================================

These files are copied unmodified from PPSSPP's ext/libkirk
(https://github.com/hrydgard/ppsspp/tree/master/ext/libkirk), which in turn is
the "Kirk Engine" by Draan, with help from coyotebean, Davee, hitchhikr, kgsws,
liquidzigong, Mathieulh, Proxima and SilverSpring, plus amctrl.c by tpu.

