  bn.c, ec.c                       GPL-2.0 or GPL-3.0 (Segher Boessenkool)
  AES.c/.h                         public domain (rijndael-alg-fst.c, OpenBSD rijndael.c)
  SHA1.c/.h                        public domain (David Ireland / A.M. Kuchling / Peter Gutmann)
  amctrl.c/.h                      reverse engineering of amctrl.prx by tpu, distributed with
                                   the GPL-3.0-or-later Kirk Engine

Because kirk_engine.c is GPL-3.0-or-later, everything that links these files
(pspc-decrypt and its tests) is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. See ../COPYING.
Nothing under PSPC's src/ may link or include these files.
